--- query
MATCH (a:User) WHERE a.age < 100 AND EXISTS { MATCH (a)-[:Follows*3..3]->(b:User) WHERE EXISTS {MATCH (b)<-[:Follows]-(c:User)} } RETURN a.name, a.age
--- expected
Adam|30
